{"articleNo":"485001","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=485001&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [스마트제조고급인력양성사업-교육생모집] GV-CNC를 활용 프로그래밍 가공 실무 교육","writer":"스마트그린제조혁신사업단","writeDate":"2024.05.21","hit":"4489","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQVkhBAygQwKoBkBuBjAUgEQE8AlAdQFEBNbAJwFMBFAeSYDoAHAOwHMg%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; color: rgb(102, 153, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 36pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 51, 153);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(242, 150, 97);\">GV-CNC</span>활용 프로그래밍 가공 실무 교육</span></span></span></b><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; color: rgb(102, 153, 255);\"><br></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(0, 51, 153); font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;교 육 생 모 집</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(0, 51, 153); font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b>1. 교육일시: 2024. 6. 3.(월) ~ 5.(수)&nbsp;10:00 ~ 15:00&nbsp;</b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">2. 교육장소: 국립금오공과대학교 공동실험실습관 101호</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">3. 교육대상: 취업준비생(대학교 재학생 3~4학년, 대학원생) / 구직자 / 재직자</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">4. 신청기한:&nbsp;<b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(217, 65, 197);\">~ 2024. 5. 30.(목</span><span style=\"color: rgb(217, 65, 197);\">) 12:00까지</span></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;※&nbsp;2024. 5. 30.(목)&nbsp;15:00까지 교육안내 문자 발송&nbsp;예정(선발되지 않은 경우, 별도의 문자 발송은 없습니다.)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5. 신청방법:</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(217, 65, 197);\">구글폼 작성(포스터 QR코드 참고)</span></span></b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">6. 교육혜택: 선착순 12명 모집 / 교육비 전액 무료 / 중식 제공</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 교육 수료(80%이상) 시,</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 사업단장 명의 수료증 발급 / Biskit 포인트 부여</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<b>&nbsp;※사전 연락 없이&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">불참</span>할 경우, 타 교육신청에&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">패널티</span>가 적용될 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</b></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">7. 교육문의: 054-478-6785(스마트그린제조혁신사업단)</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
